@@ file: data/maps/SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F/scripts.inc

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ArchieWarning:
	.string "We are TEAM BEANIE,\n"
	.string "and we take what we're owed!\p"
	.string "And I am TEAM BEANIE's boss,\n"
	.string "OMAR!\p"
	.string "What makes you get in our way?\p"
	.string "…Wait. Are you one of AHMED's\n"
	.string "guards?\p"
	.string "No, you're not wearing a suit.\n"
	.string "And you didn't ask for my ID.\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "Listen, kid. I built SAFETY ZONE\n"
	.string "with AHMED. Half of it is mine.\p"
	.string "Then he changed the password and\n"
	.string "locked me out. My own company!\p"
	.string "So TEAM BEANIE is taking my half.\n"
	.string "One submarine at a time.\p"
	.string "Don't get in our way again.\n"
	.string "And don't you forget it!$"

@@ file: data/maps/MeteorFalls_1F_1R/scripts.inc

MeteorFalls_1F_1R_Text_ArchieSeenYouBefore:
	.string "OMAR: Hold up. Didn't I see you\n"
	.string "at SLATEPORT's MUSEUM?\p"
	.string "Ah, so your name is {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Back then I thought you were one\n"
	.string "of AHMED's guards.\p"
	.string "Let me tell you about AHMED.\p"
	.string "We started SAFETY ZONE together.\n"
	.string "Fifty-fifty. Partners.\p"
	.string "Then one day I try to log in, and\n"
	.string "my password doesn't work.\p"
	.string "He CHANGED it. Didn't even tell me.\n"
	.string "Who does that?\p"
	.string "He says I don't do any work.\n"
	.string "I was doing work! Thinking work!\p"
	.string "So now it's TEAM BEANIE.\n"
	.string "And we're taking our share.$"

MeteorFalls_1F_1R_Text_ArchieYesNoTellingWhatMagmaWillDo:
	.string "OMAR: Yes, yes, let's go!\p"
	.string "There's no telling what AHMED\n"
	.string "will do at MT. CHIMNEY!$"

MeteorFalls_1F_1R_Text_ArchieFarewell:
	.string "OMAR: {PLAYER}, keep an eye out\n"
	.string "for SAFETY ZONE, too.\p"
	.string "And if you see AHMED, ask him\n"
	.string "for my password.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MtChimney/scripts.inc

MtChimney_Text_ArchieGoStopTeamMagma:
	.string "OMAR: Grr, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Of course you showed up!\p"
	.string "Look what AHMED's guards are doing!\p"
	.string "They're pouring the METEORITE's\n"
	.string "power into the volcano!\p"
	.string "He wants to wake CEASER so it's\n"
	.string "sunny forever.\p"
	.string "Sunny days, outdoor events, more\n"
	.string "security jobs. It's all about money!$"

MtChimney_Text_ArchieIHaveMyHandsFull:
	.string "OMAR: Grrr…\p"
	.string "I want to go tell AHMED off,\n"
	.string "but I can't!\p"
	.string "Three of his guards have me\n"
	.string "surrounded. They asked for my ID!$"

MtChimney_Text_ArchieThankYou:
	.string "OMAR: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Thank you!\p"
	.string "You stopped AHMED's sunshine\n"
	.string "scheme!\p"
	.string "But… You…\n"
	.string "Whose side are you on?\p"
	.string "…PROF. MO sent you?\n"
	.string "Of course he did.\p"
	.string "Tell MO I'm not coming to his\n"
	.string "peace talks.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, we'll meet again!$"

MtChimney_Text_MaxieIntro:
	.string "AHMED: Hm?\n"
	.string "Who are you?\p"
	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "I heard OMAR complaining about a kid\n"
	.string "who keeps getting in the way.\p"
	.string "Let me guess. MO sent you to make\n"
	.string "peace. Then hear my side.\p"
	.string "OMAR doesn't do ANY work.\n"
	.string "Not one shift. Not one report.\p"
	.string "And then he deletes HAMZA's help\n"
	.string "review off our page!\l"
	.string "HAMZA needed help!\p"
	.string "So yes, I changed the password.\n"
	.string "Somebody had to run this company.\p"
	.string "With the METEORITE, CEASER wakes\n"
	.string "up and brings endless sunshine.\p"
	.string "Sunny days mean outdoor events.\n"
	.string "Events need security. That's us.\p"
	.string "Now.\n"
	.string "Let me see some ID.$"

MtChimney_Text_MaxieDefeat:
	.string "What?!\p"
	.string "I, AHMED, was caught off guard?!\p"
	.string "This would never happen if OMAR\n"
	.string "worked his shifts.$"

MtChimney_Text_MaxieYouHaventSeenLastOfMagma:
	.string "AHMED: Fine.\n"
	.string "I'll back off this time.\p"
	.string "But you haven't seen the last\n"
	.string "of SAFETY ZONE.\p"
	.string "Even without the METEORITE, if we\n"
	.string "get that ORB…\p"
	.string "And tell OMAR the answer is\n"
	.string "still no.$"

@@ file: data/maps/SlateportCity_Harbor/scripts.inc

SlateportCity_Harbor_Text_ArchieYouAgainHideoutInLilycove:
