	.string "Not you again…\p"
	.string "You're as stubborn as AHMED,\n"
	.string "I'll give you that.\p"
	.string "But now…\n"
	.string "Nobody can stop us! Nobody!\p"
	.string "Or will you follow us back to our\n"
