	.string "don't. He'll ask for ID at the door.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MtPyre_Summit/scripts.inc

MtPyre_Summit_Text_ArchieWeGotTheOrbLetsGo:
	.string "OMAR: AHMED got here first and\n"
	.string "grabbed the BLUE ORB.\p"
	.string "PROF. MO set up a whole meeting up\n"
	.string "here. He even brought crazy fries.\p"
	.string "AHMED said one word about the\n"
	.string "password and left with the ORB.\p"
	.string "Fine. I've got the RED ORB.\n"
	.string "Now our plan can come to life!\p"
	.string "Okay, TEAM!\n"
	.string "We're pulling out!\p"
	.string "…Save me some fries, MO.$"

MtPyre_Summit_Text_MaxieSilence:
	.string "AHMED: {PLAYER}…\p"
	.string "OMAR and I brought the ORBS back.\n"
	.string "Then we talked. With MO. For hours.\p"
	.string "I changed the password back.\p"
	.string "OMAR: And I gave SAFETY ZONE\n"
	.string "a five-star review on YELP.\p"
	.string "Five stars. Great security.\n"
	.string "Boss is kind of strict.\p"
	.string "AHMED: …And HAMZA's review is back\n"
	.string "up, too.\p"
	.string "Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "You and MO kept the peace.$"

@@ file: data/maps/MagmaHideout_4F/scripts.inc

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieAwakenGroudon:
	.string "AHMED: CEASER…\p"
	.string "Nothing could wake you from your\n"
	.string "nap in the magma…\p"
	.string "This BLUE ORB is what you wanted.\n"
	.string "Isn't it?\p"
	.string "Wake up! Bring the sun!\n"
	.string "SAFETY ZONE has events to book!$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieOhItWasYou:
	.string "AHMED: Oh, it's you again.\p"
	.string "Let me guess. MO sent you to talk\n"
	.string "about OMAR.\p"
	.string "Fine. Let's talk about OMAR.\n"
	.string "He never shows up to work.\p"
	.string "He deleted HAMZA's help review!\n"
	.string "HAMZA asked for help! On our page!\p"
	.string "And I'm the bad guy for\n"
	.string "changing one password?$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieDefeat:
