	.string "… … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … …\p"
	.string "Humph…\n"
	.string "You think I didn't know that?\p"
	.string "He took one look at the paperwork\n"
	.string "and went back to sleep somewhere.\p"
	.string "Just like OMAR.\p"
	.string "I'm going after CEASER.\n"
	.string "This is where we part!$"

MagmaHideout_4F_Text_MaxieGroudonWhatsWrong:
	.string "AHMED: CEASER!\n"
	.string "What's wrong?\p"
	.string "Wasn't the BLUE ORB the key?\p"
	.string "CEASER!\n"
	.string "You can't nap now, we have clients!$"

